  "description": "My name is Ha-Yun Lee, and I'm an ordinary college student. I decided to go on a spontaneous trip before school resumed and met this guy named Kang-On. He asked me out on the first day we met, but of course, I rejected him. I thought I'd never see him again, but guess what? I ran into him during the school club recruitment event! And wait… What? Even Ji-Il, the president of the student club \"You,\" also has a crush on me?! I swear I'm not delulu. I swear! \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS)\n\n*Note: Includes four side story chapters.*",
